  "comment": "Gate sets for EmberdelveGateSuite. Members derived from source scan of Assets/Emberdelve/Editor/Emberdelve*Gate.cs. net = gates that call Process.Start (spawn player/server processes; async, slow). visual = Visual and RetroVisual gates (asset refresh, Process.Start for RetroVisual). combat = gates that open/create scenes, enter play mode or use isPlaying (play-mode harnesses, domain reload; need the batch runner, NOT the open editor). fast = every other gate: synchronous editor-only checks with no scene open, no play mode, no build, no process. all = fast + combat + net + visual + RuntimeSmokeTest.RunCombatFlow. Gate names are short names (Emberdelve<Name>Gate.Run) or fully qualified Namespace.Type.Method.",
